      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Connector Is a Map of Strings\nAn `aiven_kafka_connector` runs one Kafka\nConnect connector on a Connect service. Its\n`config` is one flat map of strings, the same\nkeys that the Connect REST API takes. The\nprovider checks only one thing: `config.name`\nmust equal `connector_name` ([name check](http\ns://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/\nblob/v4.66.0/internal/sdkprovider/service/kafk\na/kafka_connector.go#L115-L129)). It accepts\nany other key, including keys that Kafka\nConnect ignores.\n\nA refresh copies the live configuration into\nthe state, and an update sends the whole map.\nThe resource has no field for task health, so\na plan cannot show a connector whose tasks\nhave failed. The [Kafka map](../../kafka/kafka\n.md#kafka-connect-service-aiven-kafka-connect)\nexplains where Connect runs on Aiven.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-b7298129b221",
      "originalText": "A Connector Is a Map of Strings\nAn `aiven_kafka_connector` runs one Kafka Connect connector on a Connect service. Its `config` is one flat map of strings, the same keys that the Connect REST API takes. The provider checks only one thing: `config.name` must equal `connector_name` ([name check](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/internal/sdkprovider/service/kafka/kafka_connector.go#L115-L129)). It accepts any other key, including keys that Kafka Connect ignores.\n\nA refresh copies the live configuration into the state, and an update sends the whole map. The resource has no field for task health, so a plan cannot show a connector whose tasks have failed. The [Kafka map](../../kafka/kafka.md#kafka-connect-service-aiven-kafka-connect) explains where Connect runs on Aiven.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "a-connector-is-a-map-of-strings"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
