    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6457743618,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-bb76505ce05d",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1288.8,
      "y": 1940.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 490.0,
      "seed": 111405,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Aiven Changes Things Too\nAiven operates the services, so some changes\nhappen outside Terraform:\n\n- Maintenance updates install the latest\nconnector plugin when no version is pinned\n([connector versions](https://aiven.io/docs/pr\noducts/kafka/kafka-connect/howto/manage-connec\ntor-versions)).\n- Aiven issues new service-user certificates\nabout three months before they expire. The\ncertificates are valid for 820 days ([renew ce\nrtificates](https://aiven.io/docs/products/kaf\nka/howto/renew-ssl-certs)).\n- The power state of a service is outside\nTerraform. You turn a service on or off in the\nAiven Console or the CLI ([state](https://gith\nub.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.\n66.0/docs/resources/kafka.md#L87)).\n- After a power cycle, Aiven restores topics,\nusers, ACLs, schemas and Connect settings from\na configuration backup. It does not restore\nthe messages in classic topics ([configuration\nbackups](https://aiven.io/docs/products/kafka/\nconcepts/configuration-backup)).\n\nNone of these changes shows in a plan before\nit happens.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-bb76505ce05d",
      "originalText": "Aiven Changes Things Too\nAiven operates the services, so some changes happen outside Terraform:\n\n- Maintenance updates install the latest connector plugin when no version is pinned ([connector versions](https://aiven.io/docs/products/kafka/kafka-connect/howto/manage-connector-versions)).\n- Aiven issues new service-user certificates about three months before they expire. The certificates are valid for 820 days ([renew certificates](https://aiven.io/docs/products/kafka/howto/renew-ssl-certs)).\n- The power state of a service is outside Terraform. You turn a service on or off in the Aiven Console or the CLI ([state](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka.md#L87)).\n- After a power cycle, Aiven restores topics, users, ACLs, schemas and Connect settings from a configuration backup. It does not restore the messages in classic topics ([configuration backups](https://aiven.io/docs/products/kafka/concepts/configuration-backup)).\n\nNone of these changes shows in a plan before it happens.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "aiven-changes-things-too"
      }
    },
