    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 6264363132,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-4a432a5b72c4",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1879.6000000000001,
      "y": 4519.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 297.5,
      "seed": 823980,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Unpinned Plugin Versions\nWithout a pin, Aiven installs the latest\nconnector plugin version during maintenance,\nand it can remove deprecated versions\n([connector versions](https://aiven.io/docs/pr\noducts/kafka/kafka-connect/howto/manage-connec\ntor-versions)). A connector can then change\nbehavior with no code change. The pin lives on\nthe service, not on the connector. A Connect\nservice takes `plugin_versions` in\n`kafka_connect_user_config`. When Connect runs\non the Kafka nodes, the Kafka service takes\n`kafka_connect_plugin_versions` in\n`kafka_user_config` ([Connect service doc](htt\nps://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven\n/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_connect.md#\nL125)). A new pin restarts Kafka Connect.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-4a432a5b72c4",
      "originalText": "Unpinned Plugin Versions\nWithout a pin, Aiven installs the latest connector plugin version during maintenance, and it can remove deprecated versions ([connector versions](https://aiven.io/docs/products/kafka/kafka-connect/howto/manage-connector-versions)). A connector can then change behavior with no code change. The pin lives on the service, not on the connector. A Connect service takes `plugin_versions` in `kafka_connect_user_config`. When Connect runs on the Kafka nodes, the Kafka service takes `kafka_connect_plugin_versions` in `kafka_user_config` ([Connect service doc](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_connect.md#L125)). A new pin restarts Kafka Connect.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "unpinned-plugin-versions"
      }
    },
