      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Connectors Before Their Integration\nA dedicated Connect service reaches Kafka\nthrough an `aiven_service_integration` of type\n`kafka_connect`. The provider's docs give the\norder: the Kafka service, the topics, the\nConnect service, the integration, and then the\nconnectors ([setup order](https://github.com/a\niven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/int\nernal/sdkprovider/service/kafka/kafka_connect.\ngo#L16-L26)). A connector that refers only to\nthe Connect service name has no dependency on\nthe integration. Add `depends_on` on the\nintegration, so Terraform keeps this order.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-afa06ca3786f",
      "originalText": "Connectors Before Their Integration\nA dedicated Connect service reaches Kafka through an `aiven_service_integration` of type `kafka_connect`. The provider's docs give the order: the Kafka service, the topics, the Connect service, the integration, and then the connectors ([setup order](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/internal/sdkprovider/service/kafka/kafka_connect.go#L16-L26)). A connector that refers only to the Connect service name has no dependency on the integration. Add `depends_on` on the integration, so Terraform keeps this order.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "connectors-before-integration"
      }
    },
