      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 634281,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Schema Registry Edits\nThe plan checks a schema edit only against the\nversion in the state. With a `*_TRANSITIVE`\nlevel, or with versions that producers\nregistered themselves, the plan can pass and\nthe apply can fail. Removing\n`compatibility_level` from a subject keeps its\nlast value. Renaming the subject or changing\n`schema_type` deletes the subject softly and\nregisters it again ([schema doc](https://githu\nb.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.6\n6.0/docs/resources/kafka_schema.md#L6)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-3369451edb89",
      "originalText": "Schema Registry Edits\nThe plan checks a schema edit only against the version in the state. With a `*_TRANSITIVE` level, or with versions that producers registered themselves, the plan can pass and the apply can fail. Removing `compatibility_level` from a subject keeps its last value. Renaming the subject or changing `schema_type` deletes the subject softly and registers it again ([schema doc](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_schema.md#L6)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "schema-registry-edits"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 7372888732,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-ba8da7c65a77",
