      "height": 210.0,
      "seed": 767,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ACL Matching\nIn an Aiven ACL, `*` matches zero or more\ncharacters, dots included. So the topic\npattern `orders.*` also matches\n`orders.dlq.retry`. Every field of an ACL\nforces a new resource, so an edit deletes the\nrule and then creates the new one, with a\nshort gap in between ([ACL fields](https://git\nhub.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4\n.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_acl.md#L40-L44)). A\nnew service also has a default ACL that gives\n`avnadmin` the `admin` right on all topics.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-ba8da7c65a77",
      "originalText": "ACL Matching\nIn an Aiven ACL, `*` matches zero or more characters, dots included. So the topic pattern `orders.*` also matches `orders.dlq.retry`. Every field of an ACL forces a new resource, so an edit deletes the rule and then creates the new one, with a short gap in between ([ACL fields](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_acl.md#L40-L44)). A new service also has a default ACL that gives `avnadmin` the `admin` right on all topics.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "acl-matching"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
