      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Powered-Off Services\nWhile a service is off, plans fail, because\nthe provider first checks that the service is\nrunning ([service check](https://github.com/ai\nven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/inte\nrnal/schemautil/service.go#L1365-L1410)). A\ntopic missing after a power cycle drops out of\nthe state and is planned again ([topic doc](ht\ntps://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aive\nn/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_topic.md#L\n10)). Aiven deletes a service that stays off\nfor more than 180 days ([power off](https://ai\nven.io/docs/platform/concepts/service-power-cy\ncle)).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-9a691568dab3",
      "originalText": "Powered-Off Services\nWhile a service is off, plans fail, because the provider first checks that the service is running ([service check](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/internal/schemautil/service.go#L1365-L1410)). A topic missing after a power cycle drops out of the state and is planned again ([topic doc](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka_topic.md#L10)). Aiven deletes a service that stays off for more than 180 days ([power off](https://aiven.io/docs/platform/concepts/service-power-cycle)).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "powered-off-services"
      }
    },
