    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 8362393215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-d166d4d64d24",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1896.4,
      "y": 6079.0,
      "strokeColor": "#92400E",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 227.5,
      "seed": 912742,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Secrets the Token Cannot Read\nThe provider asks the Aiven API for secrets\nwhen it reads some resources, such as service\nusers and integration endpoints. From 1 March\n2027 the API redacts secrets unless the\ntoken's role may read them ([4.66.0 notes](htt\nps://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven\n/blob/v4.66.0/CHANGELOG.md#L34-L39); [secret r\nedaction](https://aiven.io/docs/tools/api/secr\net-redaction)). A token without such a role\nthen makes these plans fail. The environment\nvariable `AIVEN_INCLUDE_SECRETS=false` reads\nthe resources without secrets.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-d166d4d64d24",
      "originalText": "Secrets the Token Cannot Read\nThe provider asks the Aiven API for secrets when it reads some resources, such as service users and integration endpoints. From 1 March 2027 the API redacts secrets unless the token's role may read them ([4.66.0 notes](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/CHANGELOG.md#L34-L39); [secret redaction](https://aiven.io/docs/tools/api/secret-redaction)). A token without such a role then makes these plans fail. The environment variable `AIVEN_INCLUDE_SECRETS=false` reads the resources without secrets.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "secrets-token-cannot-read"
      }
    },
