    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 3625851941,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "text-e58ec16a78e0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1321.2,
      "y": 7110.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1E3A8A",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 394.8,
      "height": 175.0,
      "seed": 128442,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Pin Everything That Moves\nThree versions change behavior without a code\nchange: the provider, the connector plugins\nand Karapace. Commit the lock file for the\nprovider. Pin plugins with `plugin_versions`\nand Karapace with `karapace_version` ([Kafka r\nesource](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-pr\novider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka\n.md#L134)). Then raise each pin on purpose,\nand read the release notes first.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 17.5,
      "containerId": "node-e58ec16a78e0",
      "originalText": "Pin Everything That Moves\nThree versions change behavior without a code change: the provider, the connector plugins and Karapace. Commit the lock file for the provider. Pin plugins with `plugin_versions` and Karapace with `karapace_version` ([Kafka resource](https://github.com/aiven/terraform-provider-aiven/blob/v4.66.0/docs/resources/kafka.md#L134)). Then raise each pin on purpose, and read the release notes first.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "customData": {
        "node_id": "pin-everything-that-moves"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "rectangle",
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1072929818,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "node-2ac9b7129236",
